{"4542140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duper", "steam_appid": 4542140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4737190], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duper is a 5-player free-for-all game where strategy meets social trickery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an average 20-minute match, 5 players compete in real time to build power, make deals, and come out ahead. Each match is a contest of economics, diplomacy, and betrayal: gather resources, expand your position, negotiate trades, and decide when to cooperate and when to strike. Players compete for precious Duper Gold (🧈), the sole hard currency in the Duper ecosystem, by outsmarting each other in games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Elements and Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dying red star, every evolution begins with a surrender. And so, the story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Session starts after you match with 4 other players. In ranked mode, you can bid to compete for player colors with earlier turn order, such as Red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build soldiers, tanks, planes, and forts to grow and defend your territory. Build research centers to boost your economy, unlock global trade, and acquire special unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control territory on a shared map by expanding, capturing tiles, and pressuring your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press your advantage by using emblem cards and raising any time. Higher risk, higher reward. Not recommended for the lighthearted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade cards, blueprints, and keys every round, not just to get ahead on resource management, but also to develop important alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your base to a superunit for unrivaled combat power, by sacrificing all your future coin yield. Only for a true gambler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in free-form diplomacy with chat, quick messages, and emojis. Whether it's genuine or just to make your next backstab more seamless, no one will ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 1 player ends each game. However, everyone who holds his keys gets a share of the prize pool. Win-win situation is entirely possible—as long as someone loses big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the core game, acquire emblem cards, rare cosmetics, gold vouchers, and more in lootbox via Duper Gold, the sole hard currency in Duper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game revolves around reading other players and adapting on the fly. Alliances can help you survive, but they are never permanent. A smart deal, a timely betrayal, or a well-planned attack can completely change the outcome of a match.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duper is a 5-player free-for-all game where strategy meets social trickery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an average 20-minute match, 5 players compete in real time to build power, make deals, and come out ahead. Each match is a contest of economics, diplomacy, and betrayal: gather resources, expand your position, negotiate trades, and decide when to cooperate and when to strike. Players compete for precious Duper Gold (🧈), the sole hard currency in the Duper ecosystem, by outsmarting each other in games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Elements and Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a dying red star, every evolution begins with a surrender. And so, the story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets