1959c7efc25236f.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 1 player ends each game. However, everyone who holds his keys gets a share of the prize pool. Win-win situation is entirely possible—as long as someone loses big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the core game, acquire emblem cards, rare cosmetics, gold vouchers, and more in lootbox via Duper Gold, the sole hard currency in Duper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game revolves around reading other players and adapting on the fly. Alliances can help you survive, but they are never permanent. A smart deal, a timely betrayal, or a well-planned attack can completely change the outcome of a match.</p>", "short_description": "Duper is a 5-player real-time PvP social strategy game where players build their economy, trade resources, form alliances, and attack rivals. Every match blends negotiation, deception, and tactical decision-making as players compete to come out on top.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/c1a189acc5226b6c347e2450aa164be343f99416/header.jpg?t=1782724332", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/67e1fc1c9904156911206187554db3965409415e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782724332", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/67e1fc1c9904156911206187554db3965409415e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782724332", "website": "https://www.duper.gg/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2120 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTS 450 | AMD Radeon HD 5750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Curiosity Research Inc. "], "publishers": ["Curiosity Research Inc. "], "demos": [{"appid": 4737190, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": 